{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10103030","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10103030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010303001:0":{"text":"あなたたち……ちょっと目立ちすぎよ。","source_cn":"年轻人……你们几个，能稍微低调点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5293887D7F44CAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010303002:0":{"text":"火事の救助に来ていた子たちね。覚えてるわよ。また調査にきたの？","source_cn":"我记得你们这几张面孔，救援火灾时，你们也在。你们又来调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0D773EECB66035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010303003:0":{"text":"年をとって物忘れが酷くなってるけど、その人たちが北村の住民じゃないのは断言できるわ。","source_cn":"虽然我老了，健忘，但我敢确定，你们描述的那些人并不住在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC016114F4729625","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010303004:0":{"text":"そういえば、あの日の夕方、麦畑の中によそ者がいるってハンクが言ってたわね。同じ人たちかは分からないけど。","source_cn":"不过，那天傍晚，汉克看到了外人在麦田里走动。\\n不知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92F87AB92C683C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010303005:0":{"text":"ハンクは村で唯一の漁師よ。畑仕事よりも釣りが好きなの。","source_cn":"汉克是我们这里唯一的渔夫，他不喜欢种地，只喜欢钓鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C72CB2BEC9425AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_ti